# These scripts run inside a Nix build and in GitHub Actions, and this repo is
# edited from Windows as well as Linux. A CRLF shebang fails with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env^M", which is a genuinely awful hour to spend.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.el    text eol=lf
*.org   text eol=lf
*.nix   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
